# Web UI vs Flutter mobile

- Flutter mobile is a **WebView shell** (Google OAuth native → session handoff → Blade web app).
- User-facing screens (lookup, vocab, media, quiz, scramble, profile, …) live on **web** (`backend/resources/views`, CSS/JS). Do **not** recreate them as native Flutter screens.
- When changing those features, update the **web** app. Flutter only needs changes for shell concerns: login, WebView, theme handoff, FCM deep links, auth/API helpers.
